#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:264
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Usually omitted, but this will indicate that the font contains decorative "
"capital letters."
msgstr "通常省略，但此项可表示字体包含装饰性大写字母。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:265
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Spacing"
msgstr "间距"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:268
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"proportional or monospaced.  _Proportional_ is used since _isFixedPitch_ is "
"false."
msgstr "比例间距或等宽。由于 __isFixedPitch__ 为 false，因此使用 __Proportional__。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:272
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"All of these names are arbitrary, but one should strive to be compatible "
"with the existing conventions.  A font is referenced by name with possible "
"wild cards by an X11 program, so the name chosen should make some sense.  "
"One might begin by simply using"
msgstr "这些名称都是任意的，但应尽量遵循现有约定。X11 程序通过名称引用字体，并且可以使用通配符，因此所选名称应当合理。可以先简单地使用"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:276
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "...-normal-r-normal-...-p-...\n"
msgstr "...-normal-r-normal-...-p-...\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:279
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"as the name, and then use man:xfontsel[1] to examine it and adjust the name "
"based on the appearance of the font."
msgstr "作为名称，然后使用 man:xfontsel[1] 检查字体，并根据其外观调整名称。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:281
#, fuzzy
msgid "So, to complete our example:"
msgstr "现在，完成这个示例："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:287
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Make the font accessible to X11\n"
"% cd /usr/X11R6/lib/X11/fonts/Type1\n"
"% ln -s /usr/local/share/fonts/type1/showboat.pfb .\n"
msgstr "让 X11 能够访问该字体\n% cd /usr/X11R6/lib/X11/fonts/Type1\n% ln -s /usr/local/share/fonts/type1/showboat.pfb .\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:300
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Edit fonts.dir and fonts.scale, adding the line describing the font\n"
"and incrementing the number of fonts which is found on the first line.\n"
"% ex fonts.dir\n"
":1p\n"
"25\n"
":1c\n"
"26\n"
".\n"
":$a\n"
"showboat.pfb -type1-showboat-medium-r-normal-decorative-0-0-0-0-p-0-iso8859-1\n"
".\n"
":wq\n"
msgstr "编辑 fonts.dir 和 fonts.scale，添加描述该字体的行，并将字体数量加一。字体数量位于文件首行。\n% ex fonts.dir\n:1p\n25\n:1c\n26\n.\n:$a\nshowboat.pfb -type1-showboat-medium-r-normal-decorative-0-0-0-0-p-0-iso8859-1\n.\n:wq\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:303
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"fonts.scale seems to be identical to fonts.dir...\n"
