"Tell X11 that things have changed\n"
"% xset fp rehash\n"
msgstr "通知 X11 已有更改\n% xset fp rehash\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:309
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Examine the new font\n"
"% xfontsel -pattern -type1-*\n"
msgstr "检查新字体\n% xfontsel -pattern -type1-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:312
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"References: man:xfontsel[1], man:xset[1], The X Windows System in a "
"Nutshell, http://www.ora.com/[O'Reilly & Associates]."
msgstr "参考：man:xfontsel[1]、man:xset[1]、The X Windows System in a Nutshell、 link:http://www.ora.com/[O'Reilly & Associates]。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:314
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using Type 1 Fonts with Ghostscript"
msgstr "在 Ghostscript 中使用 Type 1 字体"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:320
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Ghostscript references a font via its [.filename]#Fontmap#.  This must be "
"modified in a similar way to the X11 [.filename]#fonts.dir#.  Ghostscript "
"can use either the [.filename]#.pfa# or the [.filename]#.pfb# format fonts.  "
"Using the font from the previous example, here is how to use it with "
"Ghostscript:"
msgstr "Ghostscript 通过 [.filename]#Fontmap# 引用字体。必须以类似 X11 [.filename]#fonts.dir# 的方式修改此文件。Ghostscript 可以使用 [.filename]#.pfa# 或 [.filename]#.pfb# 格式的字体。使用上一个示例中的字体，下面介绍如何在 Ghostscript 中使用它："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:326
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Put the font in Ghostscript's font directory\n"
"% cd /usr/local/share/ghostscript/fonts\n"
"% ln -s /usr/local/share/fonts/type1/showboat.pfb .\n"
msgstr "将字体放入 Ghostscript 的字体目录\n% cd /usr/local/share/ghostscript/fonts\n% ln -s /usr/local/share/fonts/type1/showboat.pfb .\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:334
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Edit Fontmap so Ghostscript knows about the font\n"
"% cd /usr/local/share/ghostscript/4.01\n"
"% ex Fontmap\n"
":$a\n"
"/Showboat        (showboat.pfb) ; % From CICA /fonts/atm/showboat\n"
".\n"
":wq\n"
msgstr "编辑 Fontmap，让 Ghostscript 识别该字体\n% cd /usr/local/share/ghostscript/4.01\n% ex Fontmap\n:$a\n/Showboat        (showboat.pfb) ; % From CICA /fonts/atm/showboat\n.\n:wq\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:350
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Use Ghostscript to examine the font\n"
"% gs prfont.ps\n"
"Aladdin Ghostscript 4.01 (1996-7-10)\n"
"Copyright (C) 1996 Aladdin Enterprises, Menlo Park, CA.  All rights\n"
"reserved.\n"
"This software comes with NO WARRANTY: see the file PUBLIC for details.\n"
