#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:355
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using Type 1 Fonts with Groff"
msgstr "在 Groff 中使用 Type 1 字体"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:362
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now that the new font can be used by both X11 and Ghostscript, how can one "
"use the new font with groff? First of all, since we are dealing with type 1 "
"PostScript(R) fonts, the groff device that is applicable is the _ps_ "
"device.  A font file must be created for each font that groff can use.  A "
"groff font name is just a file in [.filename]#/usr/share/groff_font/devps#.  "
"With our example, the font file could be [.filename]#/usr/share/groff_font/"
"devps/SHOWBOAT#.  The file must be created using tools provided by groff."
msgstr "现在，新字体已可供 X11 和 Ghostscript 使用，那么如何在 groff 中使用它呢？首先，由于这里使用的是 Type 1 PostScript(R) 字体，因此适用的 groff 设备是 __ps__。必须为 groff 可使用的每种字体创建一个字体文件。groff 字体名称实际上是 [.filename]#/usr/share/groff_font/devps# 中的一个文件。对于本例，字体文件可以是 [.filename]#/usr/share/groff_font/devps/SHOWBOAT#。必须使用 groff 提供的工具创建该文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:366
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The first tool is `afmtodit`.  This is not normally installed, so it must be "
"retrieved from the source distribution.  I found I had to change the first "
"line of the file, so I did:"
msgstr "第一个工具是 `afmtodit`。它通常不会随系统安装，因此必须从源代码发行版中获取。我发现需要修改该文件的首行，于是执行了以下操作："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:375
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% cp /usr/src/gnu/usr.bin/groff/afmtodit/afmtodit.pl /tmp\n"
"% ex /tmp/afmtodit.pl\n"
":1c\n"
"#!/usr/bin/perl -P-\n"
".\n"
":wq\n"
msgstr "% cp /usr/src/gnu/usr.bin/groff/afmtodit/afmtodit.pl /tmp\n% ex /tmp/afmtodit.pl\n:1c\n#!/usr/bin/perl -P-\n.\n:wq\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:379
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This tool will create the groff font file from the metrics file ([."
"filename]#.afm# suffix.)  Continuing with our example:"
msgstr "此工具会根据度量文件（后缀为 [.filename]#.afm#）创建 groff 字体文件。继续使用我们的示例："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:387
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Many .afm files are in Mac format... ^M delimited lines\n"
"We need to convert them to UNIX(R) style ^J delimited lines\n"
"% cd /tmp\n"
"% cat /usr/local/share/fonts/type1/showboat.afm |\n"
"\ttr '\\015' '\\012' >showboat.afm\n"
msgstr "Many .afm files are in Mac format... ^M delimited lines\nWe need to convert them to UNIX(R) style ^J delimited lines\n% cd /tmp\n% cat /usr/local/share/fonts/type1/showboat.afm |\n\ttr '\\015' '\\012' >showboat.afm\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:391
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now create the groff font file\n"
"% cd /usr/share/groff_font/devps\n"
"% /tmp/afmtodit.pl -d DESC -e text.enc /tmp/showboat.afm generate/textmap SHOWBOAT\n"
msgstr "Now create the groff font file\n% cd /usr/share/groff_font/devps\n% /tmp/afmtodit.pl -d DESC -e text.enc /tmp/showboat.afm generate/textmap SHOWBOAT\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:394
#, fuzzy
msgid "The font can now be referenced with the name SHOWBOAT."
msgstr "现在可以使用名称 SHOWBOAT 引用该字体。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:401
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If Ghostscript is used to drive the printers on the system, then nothing "
"more needs to be done.  However, if true PostScript(R) printers are used, "
"then the font must be downloaded to the printer in order for the font to be "
"used (unless the printer happens to have the showboat font built in or on an "
"accessible font disk.)  The final step is to create a downloadable font.  "
"The `pfbtops` tool is used to create the [.filename]#.pfa# format of the "
"font, and [.filename]#download# is modified to reference the new font.  The "
"[.filename]#download# must reference the internal name of the font.  This "
"can easily be determined from the groff font file as illustrated:"
msgstr "如果系统使用 Ghostscript 驱动打印机，则无需再做其他操作。不过，如果使用真正的 PostScript(R) 打印机，则必须将字体下载到打印机，才能使用该字体（除非打印机内置了 showboat 字体，或者字体位于可访问的字体磁盘上）。最后一步是创建可下载的字体。使用 `pfbtops` 工具创建字体的 [.filename]#.pfa# 格式，并修改 [.filename]#download# 以引用新字体。文件 [.filename]#download# 必须引用字体的内部名称。如下所示，可以轻松地从 groff 字体文件中确定该名称："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:406
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Create the .pfa font file\n"
"% pfbtops /usr/local/share/fonts/type1/showboat.pfb >showboat.pfa\n"
msgstr "Create the .pfa font file\n% pfbtops /usr/local/share/fonts/type1/showboat.pfb >showboat.pfa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:409
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Of course, if [.filename]#.pfa# is already available, just use a symbolic "
"link to reference it."
msgstr "当然，如果已有 [.filename]#.pfa# 文件，只需创建一个符号链接来引用它即可。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:421
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Get the internal font name\n"
"% fgrep internalname SHOWBOAT\n"
"internalname Showboat\n"
"Tell groff that the font must be downloaded\n"
"% ex download\n"
":$a\n"
"Showboat      showboat.pfa\n"
".\n"
":wq\n"
msgstr "Get the internal font name\n% fgrep internalname SHOWBOAT\ninternalname Showboat\nTell groff that the font must be downloaded\n% ex download\n:$a\nShowboat      showboat.pfa\n.\n:wq\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:424
#, fuzzy
msgid "To test the font:"
msgstr "测试字体："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:455
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% cd /tmp\n"
"% cat >example.t <<EOF\n"
".sp 5\n"
".ps 16\n"
"This is an example of the Showboat font:\n"
".br\n"
".ps 48\n"
".vs (\\n(.s+2)p\n"
".sp\n"
".ft SHOWBOAT\n"
"ABCDEFGHI\n"
".br\n"
"JKLMNOPQR\n"
".br\n"
"STUVWXYZ\n"
".sp\n"
".ps 16\n"
".vs (\\n(.s+2)p\n"
".fp 5 SHOWBOAT\n"
".ft R\n"
"To use it for the first letter of a paragraph, it will look like:\n"
".sp 50p\n"
"\\s(48\\f5H\\s0\\fRere is the first sentence of a paragraph that uses the\n"
"showboat font as its first letter.\n"
"Additional vertical space must be used to allow room for the larger\n"
"letter.\n"
"EOF\n"
"% groff -Tps example.t >example.ps\n"
msgstr "% cd /tmp\n% cat >example.t <<EOF\n.sp 5\n.ps 16\nThis is an example of the Showboat font:\n.br\n.ps 48\n.vs (\\n(.s+2)p\n.sp\n.ft SHOWBOAT\nABCDEFGHI\n.br\nJKLMNOPQR\n.br\nSTUVWXYZ\n.sp\n.ps 16\n.vs (\\n(.s+2)p\n.fp 5 SHOWBOAT\n.ft R\nTo use it for the first letter of a paragraph, it will look like:\n.sp 50p\n\\s(48\\f5H\\s0\\fRere is the first sentence of a paragraph that uses the\nshowboat font as its first letter.\nAdditional vertical space must be used to allow room for the larger\nletter.\nEOF\n% groff -Tps example.t >example.ps\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:458
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To use ghostscript/ghostview\n"
"% ghostview example.ps\n"
msgstr "使用 ghostscript/ghostview\n% ghostview example.ps\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:461
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To print it\n"
"% lpr -Ppostscript example.ps\n"
msgstr "打印\n% lpr -Ppostscript example.ps\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:464
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"References: [.filename]#/usr/src/gnu/usr.bin/groff/afmtodit/afmtodit.man#, "
"man:groff_font[5], man:groff_char[7], man:pfbtops[1]."
msgstr "参考资料： [.filename]#/usr/src/gnu/usr.bin/groff/afmtodit/afmtodit.man#、man:groff_font[5]、man:groff_char[7]、man:pfbtops[1]。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:466
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Converting TrueType Fonts to a groff/PostScript Format For groff"
