msgstr "根据 ASCII 字体度量文件创建供 groff 使用的字体文件。该工具通常位于目录 [.filename]#/usr/src/contrib/groff/afmtodit# 中，并且需要做一些准备工作才能运行。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:498
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you are paranoid about working in the [.filename]#/usr/src# tree, simply "
"copy the contents of the above directory to a work location."
msgstr "如果你不愿意在 [.filename]#/usr/src# 树中操作，只需将上述目录的内容复制到一个工作目录即可。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:502
#, fuzzy
msgid "In the work area, you will need to make the utility.  Just type:"
msgstr "在工作目录中，需要编译该工具。只需输入："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:506
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# make -f Makefile.sub afmtodit\n"
msgstr "# make -f Makefile.sub afmtodit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:509
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You may also need to copy [.filename]#/usr/contrib/groff/devps/generate/"
"textmap# to [.filename]#/usr/share/groff_font/devps/generate# if it does not "
"already exist."
msgstr "如果 [.filename]#/usr/share/groff_font/devps/generate# 中尚不存在 [.filename]#textmap#，你可能还需要将 [.filename]#/usr/contrib/groff/devps/generate/textmap# 复制到该目录。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:511
#, fuzzy
msgid "Once all these utilities are in place, you are ready to commence:"
msgstr "准备好所有这些工具后，就可以开始了："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:513
#, fuzzy
msgid "Create [.filename]#.afm# by typing:"
msgstr "输入以下命令创建 [.filename]#.afm#："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:517
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% gs -dNODISPLAY -q -- ttf2pf.ps TTF_name PS_font_name AFM_name\n"
msgstr "% gs -dNODISPLAY -q -- ttf2pf.ps TTF_name PS_font_name AFM_name\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:520
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Where, _TTF_name_ is your TrueType font file, _PS_font_name_ is the file "
"name for [.filename]#.pfa#, _AFM_name_ is the name you wish for [.filename]#."
"afm#. If you do not specify output file names for the [.filename]#.pfa# or [."
"filename]#.afm# files, then default names will be generated from the "
"TrueType font file name."
msgstr "其中，_TTF_name_ 是 TrueType 字体文件，_PS_font_name_ 是 [.filename]#.pfa# 文件的文件名，_AFM_name_ 是你希望用于 [.filename]#.afm# 的名称。如果未指定 [.filename]#.pfa# 或 [.filename]#.afm# 文件的输出文件名，则会根据 TrueType 字体文件名生成默认名称。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:523
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This also produces a [.filename]#.pfa#, the ascii PostScript font metrics "
"file ([.filename]#.pfb# is for the binary form).  This will not be needed, "
"but could (I think) be useful for a fontserver."
msgstr "此操作还会生成一个 [.filename]#.pfa# 文件，即 ASCII PostScript 字体度量文件（[.filename]#.pfb# 是其二进制格式）。虽然不需要此文件，但它可能（我认为）对字体服务器有用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:525
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For example, to convert the 30f9 Barcode font using the default file names, "
"use the following command:"
msgstr "例如，要使用默认文件名转换 30f9 Barcode 字体，请使用以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:533
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% gs -dNODISPLAY -- ttf2pf.ps 3of9.ttf\n"
"Aladdin Ghostscript 5.10 (1997-11-23)\n"
"Copyright (C) 1997 Aladdin Enterprises, Menlo Park, CA.  All rights reserved.\n"
"This software comes with NO WARRANTY: see the file PUBLIC for details.\n"
"Converting 3of9.ttf to 3of9.pfa and 3of9.afm.\n"
msgstr "% gs -dNODISPLAY -- ttf2pf.ps 3of9.ttf\nAladdin Ghostscript 5.10 (1997-11-23)\nCopyright (C) 1997 Aladdin Enterprises, Menlo Park, CA.  All rights reserved.\nThis software comes with NO WARRANTY: see the file PUBLIC for details.\nConverting 3of9.ttf to 3of9.pfa and 3of9.afm.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:536
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you want the converted fonts to be stored in [.filename]#A.pfa# and [."
"filename]#B.afm#, then use this command:"
msgstr "如果要将转换后的字体分别保存为 [.filename]#A.pfa# 和 [.filename]#B.afm#，请使用以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:544
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% gs -dNODISPLAY -- ttf2pf.ps 3of9.ttf A B\n"
"Aladdin Ghostscript 5.10 (1997-11-23)\n"
"Copyright (C) 1997 Aladdin Enterprises, Menlo Park, CA.  All rights reserved.\n"
"This software comes with NO WARRANTY: see the file PUBLIC for details.\n"
"Converting 3of9.ttf to A.pfa and B.afm.\n"
msgstr "% gs -dNODISPLAY -- ttf2pf.ps 3of9.ttf A B\nAladdin Ghostscript 5.10 (1997-11-23)\nCopyright (C) 1997 Aladdin Enterprises, Menlo Park, CA.  All rights reserved.\nThis software comes with NO WARRANTY: see the file PUBLIC for details.\nConverting 3of9.ttf to A.pfa and B.afm.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:547
#, fuzzy
msgid "Create the groff PostScript file:"
msgstr "创建 groff PostScript 文件："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:551
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Change directories to [.filename]#/usr/share/groff_font/devps# so as to make "
"the following command easier to execute.  You will probably need root "
"privileges for this.  (Or, if you are paranoid about working there, make "
"sure you reference the files [.filename]#DESC#, [.filename]#text.enc# and [."
"filename]#generate/textmap# as being in this directory.)"
msgstr "切换到 [.filename]#/usr/share/groff_font/devps# 目录，以便更方便地执行以下命令。你可能需要 root 权限。（或者，如果你不愿意在该目录中操作，请确保将文件 [.filename]#DESC#、[.filename]#text.enc# 和 [.filename]#generate/textmap# 指定为此目录中的文件。）"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:555
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% afmtodit -d DESC -e text.enc file.afm generate/textmap PS_font_name\n"
msgstr "% afmtodit -d DESC -e text.enc file.afm generate/textmap PS_font_name\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:559
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Where, [.filename]#file.afm# is the _AFM_name_ created by `ttf2pf.ps` above, "
"and _PS_font_name_ is the font name used from that command, as well as the "
"name that man:groff[1] will use for references to this font.  For example, "
"assuming you used the first `tiff2pf.ps` above, then the 3of9 Barcode font "
"can be created using the command:"
msgstr "其中，[.filename]#file.afm# 是上文通过 `ttf2pf.ps` 创建的 _AFM_name_，而 _PS_font_name_ 是该命令中使用的字体名称，也是 man:groff[1] 引用该字体时使用的名称。例如，假设你使用了上文第一个 `tiff2pf.ps` 命令，则可以使用以下命令创建 3of9 Barcode 字体："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:563
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% afmtodit -d DESC -e text.enc 3of9.afm generate/textmap 3of9\n"
msgstr "% afmtodit -d DESC -e text.enc 3of9.afm generate/textmap 3of9\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:566
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Ensure that the resulting _PS_font_name_ file (e.g., [.filename]#3of9# in "
"the example above) is located in the directory [.filename]#/usr/share/"
"groff_font/devps# by copying or moving it there."
msgstr "请将生成的 _PS_font_name_ 文件（例如上例中的 [.filename]#3of9#）复制或移动到目录 [.filename]#/usr/share/groff_font/devps# 中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:569
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Note that if [.filename]#ttf2pf.ps# assigns a font name using the one it "
"finds in the TrueType font file and you want to use a different name, you "
"must edit the [.filename]#.afm# prior to running `afmtodit`.  This name must "
"also match the one used in the Fontmap file if you wish to pipe man:groff[1] "
"into man:gs[1]."
msgstr "请注意，如果 [.filename]#ttf2pf.ps# 使用从 TrueType 字体文件中找到的字体名称，而你希望使用其他名称，则必须在运行 `afmtodit` 之前编辑 [.filename]#.afm# 文件。如果希望将 man:groff[1] 的输出通过管道传给 man:gs[1]，此名称还必须与 Fontmap 文件中使用的名称相匹配。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:571
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Can TrueType Fonts be Used with Other Programs?"
msgstr "TrueType 字体能否用于其他程序？"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:575
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The TrueType font format is used by Windows, Windows 95, and Mac's.  It is "
"quite popular and there are a great number of fonts available in this format."
msgstr "Windows、Windows 95 和 Mac 都使用 TrueType 字体格式。该格式相当流行，有大量可用字体。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:579
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, there are few applications that I am aware of that can use "
"this format: Ghostscript and Povray come to mind.  Ghostscript's support, "
"according to the documentation, is rudimentary and the results are likely to "
"be inferior to type 1 fonts.  Povray version 3 also has the ability to use "
"TrueType fonts, but I rather doubt many people will be creating documents as "
"a series of raytraced pages :-)."
msgstr "遗憾的是，据我所知，能够使用这种格式的应用程序不多：Ghostscript 和 Povray 是其中的两个。根据文档，Ghostscript 对该格式的支持还很基础，效果可能不如 type 1 字体。Povray 3 也可以使用 TrueType 字体，不过我很怀疑有多少人会把文档制作成一系列光线追踪页面 ：-)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:582
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This rather dismal situation may soon change.  The http://www.freetype.org/"
"[FreeType Project] is currently developing a useful set of FreeType tools:"
msgstr "这种不太理想的状况可能很快会有所改变。 link:http://www.freetype.org/[FreeType Project] 目前正在开发一套实用的 FreeType 工具："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:584
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `xfsft` font server for X11 can serve TrueType fonts in addition to "
"regular fonts. Though currently in beta, it is said to be quite usable. See "
"http://www.dcs.ed.ac.uk/home/jec/programs/xfsft/[Juliusz Chroboczek's page] "
"for further information. Porting instructions for FreeBSD can be found at "
"http://math.missouri.edu/~stephen/software/[Stephen Montgomery's software "
"page]."
msgstr "用于 X11 的 `xfsft` 字体服务器除了普通字体外，也能提供 TrueType 字体。它目前仍处于测试阶段，但据说已经相当实用。更多信息请参阅 link:http://www.dcs.ed.ac.uk/home/jec/programs/xfsft/[Juliusz Chroboczek 的页面]。FreeBSD 的移植说明可参阅 link:http://math.missouri.edu/~stephen/software/[Stephen Montgomery 的软件页面]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:585
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"xfstt is another font server for X11, available under link:ftp://sunsite.unc."
"edu/pub/Linux/X11/fonts/[ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/X11/fonts/]."
msgstr "`xfstt` 是另一个适用于 X11 的字体服务器，可从 link:ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/X11/fonts/[ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/X11/fonts/] 获取。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:586
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A program called `ttf2bdf` can produce BDF files suitable for use in an X "
"environment from TrueType files. Linux binaries are said to be available "
"from link:ftp://crl.nmsu.edu/CLR/multiling/General/[ftp://crl.nmsu.edu/CLR/"
"multiling/General/]."
msgstr "名为 `ttf2bdf` 的程序可以将 TrueType 文件转换为适用于 X 环境的 BDF 文件。据称，可从 link:ftp://crl.nmsu.edu/CLR/multiling/General/[ftp://crl.nmsu.edu/CLR/multiling/General/] 获取 Linux 二进制文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:587
#, fuzzy
msgid "and others ..."
msgstr "等等……"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:589
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Where Can Additional Fonts be Obtained?"
msgstr "还可以从哪里获取其他字体？"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/fonts/_index.adoc:594
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Many fonts are available on the Internet.  They are either entirely free, or "
"are share-ware.  In addition many fonts are available in the [.filename]#x11-"
"fonts/# category in the ports collection"
msgstr "互联网上有许多字体。它们要么完全免费，要么以共享软件形式提供。此外，ports collection 的 [.filename]#x11-fonts/# 分类中也有许多字体。"

